      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El Cofagrigus se fue...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 4888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006C00200043006F006600610067007200690067007500730020007300650020006600750065002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Se le cayó algo mientras escapaba!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 4936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005300650020006C0065002000630061007900F300200061006C0067006F0020006D00690065006E007400720061007300200065007300630061007000610062006100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La presencia de Cofagrigus se percibe aún en\nlas alcantarillas.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 5008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C0061002000700072006500730065006E00630069006100200064006500200043006F00660061006700720069006700750073002000730065002000700065007200630069006200650020006100FA006E00200065006E000A006C0061007300200061006C00630061006E0074006100720069006C006C00610073002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿6",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 5136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Mis ojos! ¡Hay mucha luz!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 5148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004D006900730020006F006A006F00730021002000A10048006100790020006D00750063006800610020006C0075007A002100100002011401D60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Estás bien?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 5212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00450073007400E100730020006200690065006E003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué pasó?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 5240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0051007500E9002000700061007300F3003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ay, qué vergüenza... En Ciudad Luminalia hay\nunos Pokémon muy extraños...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nResulta que me emocioné tanto al encontrarme\ncon el Cofagrigus que...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 5264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 151
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me puse muy eufórico y empecé a gritar.\nSeguramente eso lo molestó.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 5568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065002000700075007300650020006D00750079002000650075006600F3007200690063006F0020007900200065006D00700065006300E9002000610020006700720069007400610072002E000A005300650067007500720061006D0065006E00740065002000650073006F0020006C006F0020006D006F006C00650073007400F3002E00100002011401D60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y entonces se enojó y me tragó.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 5712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005900200065006E0074006F006E00630065007300200073006500200065006E006F006A00F3002000790020006D00650020007400720061006700F3002E00100002011401D60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El caso es que me encontraba tan a gusto en su\ninterior que seguramente me quedé dormido.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 5784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero bueno, ¡muchas gracias por rescatarme!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 5972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000650072006F0020006200750065006E006F002C002000A1006D007500630068006100730020006700720061006300690061007300200070006F0072002000720065007300630061007400610072006D0065002100100002011401D60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Puede que haya alguien en el interior de alguno\nde esos Cofagrigus, así que vamos a buscarlos.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 6068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿@",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 6268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00400000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Eso, bien hecho!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 6280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100450073006F002C0020006200690065006E00200068006500630068006F0021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Salvamos a la persona que pedía auxilio.\n¡Somos lo máximo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 6324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530061006C00760061006D006F0073002000610020006C006100200070006500720073006F006E00610020007100750065002000700065006400ED006100200061007500780069006C0069006F002E000A00A10053006F006D006F00730020006C006F0020006D00E100780069006D006F0021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Verdad que da gusto hacer algo por el bien de\nCiudad Luminalia?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 6452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF005600650072006400610064002000710075006500200064006100200067007500730074006F00200068006100630065007200200061006C0067006F00200070006F007200200065006C0020006200690065006E002000640065000A0043006900750064006100640020004C0075006D0069006E0061006C00690061003F001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tendrías que darme las gracias por haberte\navisado de lo que sucedía.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 6592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540065006E0064007200ED0061007300200071007500650020006400610072006D00650020006C006100730020006700720061006300690061007300200070006F007200200068006100620065007200740065000A006100760069007300610064006F0020006400650020006C006F002000710075006500200073007500630065006400ED0061002E001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Detrás de ti...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 6740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004400650074007200E10073002000640065002000740069002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
